# [subcommand ...] word<TAB>description
add	Stage changes
bisect	Find a commit that introduced a bug
blame	Show who last changed each line
branch	List, create or delete branches
checkout	Switch branches or restore files
clone	Clone a repository
commit	Record staged changes
diff	Show changes
fetch	Download from a remote
init	Create a repository
log	Show commit history
merge	Join histories
mv	Move a tracked file
pull	Fetch and integrate
push	Update a remote
rebase	Reapply commits on another base
reflog	Show where references have been
remote	Manage remotes
reset	Move the current branch
restore	Restore working tree files
revert	Undo a commit with a new one
rm	Remove tracked files
show	Show an object
stash	Set changes aside
status	Show the working tree state
switch	Switch branches
tag	Manage tags
worktree	Manage extra working trees
add --patch	Choose hunks interactively
add --all	Stage everything
commit --amend	Replace the last commit
commit --message	Set the message
commit --all	Stage tracked changes first
commit --fixup	Prepare a fixup commit
diff --staged	Compare the index with HEAD
diff --stat	Show a summary
log --oneline	One line per commit
log --graph	Draw the commit graph
log --stat	Show changed files
push --force-with-lease	Force only over what you have seen
push --set-upstream	Remember the remote branch
push --tags	Push tags too
rebase --interactive	Edit the commit list
rebase --continue	Go on after a conflict
rebase --abort	Stop and go back
reset --hard	Discard working tree changes
reset --soft	Keep changes staged
stash pop	Apply and drop the last stash
stash list	List stashes
stash push	Save changes
